<title>K-Pg Impact Winter</title>
<meta name="claude:viewport-fit-sides" content="cover">
<style>
/* Layout: control console on top; 2x2 chart grid (~75%) beside a terminal-style readout (~25%); stacks on phones */
:root {
  --bg: #d3c6b5;        /* page background (Christina's pick) */
  --ink: #2c241a;       /* dark brown text */
  --card: #e6dccf;      /* lighter tan for panels */
  --line: #b8a991;      /* hairlines */
  --green: #8fb195;  --green-ink: #4f7a58;
  --violet: #a78ada; --violet-ink: #6c4fa3;
  --pink: #c59fc5;   --pink-ink: #94608f;
  --brown: #ba6c3f;
  --peach: #e1bca7;
  --yellow: #d9b54a; --yellow-ink: #9a7a1c;
  --serif: "Times New Roman", Times, "Liberation Serif", serif;
  --mono: "Courier New", Courier, monospace;
  color-scheme: light;
}
body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink); font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.45; }
.wrap { max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; padding-block: 28px 40px;
  padding-left: max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-left, 0px)); padding-right: max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-right, 0px));
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; }
header h1 { font-size: clamp(30px, 5vw, 46px); line-height: 1.05; margin: 0; font-weight: 700; text-wrap: balance; }
header p { margin: 6px 0 0; max-width: 68ch; }
.eyebrow { font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--brown); font-weight: 700; }
.chain { font-style: italic; font-size: 15px; }

.console { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 14px 22px; background: var(--card);
  border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; padding: 14px 18px; }
.toggle { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; cursor: pointer; user-select: none; font-size: 18px; }
.toggle input { position: absolute; opacity: 0; width: 1px; height: 1px; }
.track { width: 46px; height: 26px; border-radius: 13px; background: var(--line); position: relative; transition: background .2s; flex: none; }
.track::after { content: ""; position: absolute; top: 3px; left: 3px; width: 20px; height: 20px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--card); transition: transform .2s; box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgb(44 36 26 / .35); }
.toggle input:checked + .track { background: var(--violet); }
.toggle input:checked + .track::after { transform: translateX(20px); }
.toggle input:focus-visible + .track { outline: 2px solid var(--ink); outline-offset: 2px; }
.toggle small { display: block; font-size: 13px; opacity: .75; }
#run { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #fbf4ec; background: var(--brown);
  border: 0; border-radius: 4px; padding: 10px 20px; cursor: pointer; box-shadow: 0 2px 0 #8a4c2a; }
#run:hover { filter: brightness(1.07); }
#run:active { transform: translateY(2px); box-shadow: none; }
#run:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--ink); outline-offset: 2px; }
#run.stale { animation: nudge 1.6s ease-in-out infinite; }
@keyframes nudge { 50% { box-shadow: 0 2px 0 #8a4c2a, 0 0 0 5px rgb(186 108 63 / .3); } }
.showing { margin-left: auto; font-size: 15px; }
.showing b { font-size: 17px; }

.main { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 3fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 20px; align-items: start; }
.grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 14px; }
.chart { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px 10px 4px; min-width: 0; }
.chart h2 { margin: 0 0 0 6px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; }
.chart .sub { margin: 0 0 0 6px; font-size: 13px; opacity: .75; }
.plot { height: 270px; }

aside { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; min-width: 0; }
.term { background: var(--ink); color: var(--peach); border-radius: 6px; padding: 14px; font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; overflow-x: auto; }
.term pre { margin: 0; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; }
.term .k { color: var(--green); } .term .h { color: #f3e6d6; font-weight: 700; } .term .dim { opacity: .65; }
.notes { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px 14px; font-size: 15px; }
.notes h3 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 16px; }
.notes p { margin: 0 0 8px; } .notes p:last-child { margin: 0; }
.preview-tag { display: inline-block; background: var(--peach); border: 1px solid var(--brown); color: var(--ink);
  font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 3px; font-weight: 700; }
footer { font-size: 14px; opacity: .8; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 10px; }

@media (max-width: 980px) { .main { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); } }
@media (max-width: 640px) { .grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); } .showing { margin-left: 0; } .plot { height: 240px; } }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { * { transition: none !important; animation: none !important; } }
</style>
<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/plotly.js/2.35.2/plotly.min.js"></script>

<div class="wrap">
  <header>
    <div class="eyebrow">02-120 project &middot; <span class="preview-tag">Preview</span></div>
    <h1>K-Pg Impact Winter</h1>
    <p>How much did the asteroid impact 66 million years ago disrupt climate and ecosystems? Switch the soot and sulfate on or off, press Run, and hover the graphs for exact values.</p>
    <p class="chain">Haze (aerosol optical depth) &rarr; sunlight at the surface &rarr; temperature &rarr; photosynthesis &rarr; food web</p>
  </header>

  <section class="console" aria-label="Simulation controls">
    <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="soot" checked><span class="track"></span>
      <span>Soot<small>from global wildfires</small></span></label>
    <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="sulf" checked><span class="track"></span>
      <span>Sulfate<small>from vaporized rock</small></span></label>
    <button id="run" type="button">Run simulation</button>
    <div class="showing" aria-live="polite">Showing: <b id="showing">Soot + sulfate</b></div>
  </section>

  <div class="main">
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="chart"><h2>Sunlight at surface</h2><p class="sub">% of normal</p><div class="plot" id="p-trans"></div></div>
      <div class="chart"><h2>Surface temperature</h2><p class="sub">&deg;C, global mean</p><div class="plot" id="p-Ts"></div></div>
      <div class="chart"><h2>Photosynthesis</h2><p class="sub">% of normal</p><div class="plot" id="p-prod"></div></div>
      <div class="chart"><h2>Food web</h2><p class="sub">biomass, % of normal (log scale)</p><div class="plot" id="p-web"></div></div>
    </div>
    <aside>
      <div class="term" aria-label="Model output"><pre id="term"></pre></div>
      <div class="notes">
        <h3>Reading the graphs</h3>
        <p>The time axis stretches the first year (monthly steps), then counts years on a log scale out to 60.</p>
        <p>The dashed gray line is the no-impact control. It stays flat at 15 &deg;C (288 K), which checks that the model is balanced before the impact.</p>
        <p>This is a simple global-mean model. The three food-web levels are generic groups, not counts of any species.</p>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>

  <footer>Preview built from <code>run()</code> in <code>main.py</code> with the default scenario (soot &tau; = 8.0, lasting 1.5 yr; sulfate &tau; = 2.0, lasting 3.0 yr). The real site will read <code>data.json</code> from <code>export_data.py</code>.</footer>
</div>
EOF
